ination"},{"start":1093.48,"end":1094.84,"text":"Aus e"},{"start":1094.84,"end":1096.12,"text":"Und i"},{"start":1096.12,"end":1099.039,"text":"Und die beiden zusammen werden immer als"},{"start":1099.039,"end":1100.08,"text":"Ei"},{"start":1100.08,"end":1101.58,"text":"Ausgesprochen"},{"start":1102.159,"end":1103.659,"text":"Ei"},{"start":1104.2,"end":1105.7,"text":"Ei"},{"start":1105.72,"end":1106.72,"text":"Mein"},{"start":1106.72,"end":1108.22,"text":"Stein"},{"start":1110.64,"end":1114.039,"text":"Dann haben wir noch die Kombination A"},{"start":1114.039,"end":1117.799,"text":"+ i und das spricht man auch i"},{"start":1117.799,"end":1121.36,"text":"Aus also so wie die Kombination E"},{"start":1121.36,"end":1122.84,"text":"+ i"},{"start":1122.84,"end":1125.32,"text":"Aber ihr könnt euch merken"},{"start":1125.32,"end":1129.08,"text":"Die Kombination A + i die kommt im Deutschen"},{"start":1129.08,"end":1132.32,"text":"Gar nicht so oft vor das sind nur ein paar Wörter"},{"start":1132.32,"end":1135.799,"text":"Und E + i ist tatsächlich viel"},{"start":1135.799,"end":1136.799,"text":"Häufiger"},{"start":1136.799,"end":1138.299,"text":"I"},{"start":1140.039,"end":1141.539,"text":"Ei"},{"start":1141.72,"end":1143.2,"text":"Seite"},{"start":1143.2,"end":1144.7,"text":"Leib"},{"start":1145.28,"end":1146.28,"text":"Weise"},{"start":1146.28,"end":1149.76,"text":"Dann gibt es noch die Kombination aus a"},{"start":1149.76,"end":1153.88,"text":"Und U und das wird zusammen einfach"},{"start":1153.88,"end":1155.039,"text":"Au"},{"start":1155.039,"end":1156.539,"text":"Ausgesprochen"},{"start":1156.96,"end":1158.46,"text":"Au"},{"start":1159.679,"end":1161.179,"text":"Au"},{"start":1161.44,"end":1162.94,"text":"Stau"},{"start":1163.24,"end":1164.74,"text":"Bauen"},{"start":1165.12,"end":1166.12,"text":"Mauer"},{"start":1166.12,"end":1169.679,"text":"Der nächste difton ist vielleicht ein bisschen"},{"start":1169.679,"end":1170.679,"text":"Schwierig"},{"start":1170.679,"end":117